  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/1790), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5438809)[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53204829), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/cafe_OK), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/jt_sr_0071)  \nWelcome to Mr. Bibi's Cafe OK, Dominica]\n\n“There is a story that no one can tell.“  \nBibi, the owner of the mountain, who greets animal friends visiting Cafe OK, deep in the forest with different concerns.  \nMr. Bibi, a cat, listens to guests quietly, encourages them, and serves warm tea and freshly baked bread snacks.  \nThat cafe, I want to go too!",
